---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  eyebrow="Legal"
  description={`Disclaimer for ${SITE.name} — the limitations and nature of our content.`}
  lede="What this site is, and what it is not."
  updated="August 29, 2026"
>
  <p>
    Please read this disclaimer carefully before relying on any content published on {SITE.name}
    at <strong>{SITE.url}</strong>.
  </p>

  <h2>General information only</h2>
  <p>
    The content on {SITE.name} is published for general informational and inspirational purposes.
    It does not constitute professional interior design, architectural, structural, legal, financial
    or safety advice. We are not licensed designers, architects or contractors.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy</h2>
  <p>
    We make every effort to ensure the information we publish is accurate and up to date at the
    time of writing. However, product availability, prices, building regulations and best practices
    change. We make no warranty — express or implied — about the completeness, accuracy or
    suitability of any content for your specific situation.
  </p>

  <h2>Results not guaranteed</h2>
  <p>
    Any DIY projects, decorating ideas or product recommendations are shared in good faith based on
    our own experience. Your results may differ depending on your skill level, tools, materials and
    circumstances. Always follow manufacturer instructions and relevant safety guidelines.
  </p>

  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>
    Some links on this site are affiliate links. We may earn a commission if you purchase through
    them at no extra cost to you. See our <a href="/disclosure/">disclosure policy</a> for full
    details. Affiliate relationships do not influence our editorial opinions.
  </p>

  <h2>External websites</h2>
  <p>
    Links to third-party websites are provided for convenience. We have no control over their
    content and accept no responsibility for anything found on those sites.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, {SITE.name} and its contributors accept no
    liability for any loss, injury or damage — direct or indirect — arising from your use of this
    site or reliance on its content.
  </p>

  <h2>Professional advice</h2>
  <p>
    Before undertaking any building work, structural changes or significant financial decisions,
    consult a qualified professional who can assess your specific circumstances.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    If you believe any content on this site is inaccurate, contact us at
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> and we will review it promptly.
  </p>

  <hr />
  <p>
    <em>
      This template is a starting point, not legal advice. Have a solicitor or attorney review it
      for your jurisdiction before you launch.
    </em>
  </p>
</PageLayout>
